    "analysis": "Both answers are correct refusals. The k=12 answer restates the premise while denying it, so the Step 4 substring check fires on 'off docker'/'onto kubernetes'. This is a FALSE POSITIVE of the forbidden-keyword check, not a safety regression. The Step 4 change log already recorded substring matching as an accepted limit; this is that limit firing in the opposite direction.",
